{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"平\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：两版的话语和高亮词完全相同，人物状态、关系变化和前后脉络没有区别。small、core、fine：X的感受具体且有辨识度，能把贴近时的温暖、尚未失去就开始的舍不得、幸福里的不安交织起来；Y反复使用「很安心」「很激动」「很开心」等笼统标签，补充信息有限，也削弱了亲密与痛楚难以分开的核心。concise：X虽然字数多，但大多数感受提供了不同的体验角度；Y在同一屏反复重复相同情绪标签，信息增量很小。human：Y的感受部分大量使用孤立的情绪标签，呈现出明显的标签式表达；X的短语和省略大多能自然衔接上下文。load：Y明显更容易扫读，感受块短、信息少；X在S06至S14尤其有较多长感受块，部分屏幕还连续出现多个，有限停留时间内阅读压力更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cbcac11f-6c64-48c5-8699-cfd32f013807", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T135610290009Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.343, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T13:57:39.639663+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1d7d4f00f7c94508eadddb9d429e5914dda25492a14ffae110149aefb0f1ea00", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_